================================================================================
Deploy pre-flight: fix size-budget regressions from Knowledge Pages work
================================================================================

Context:
Requested "deploy". Pre-flight tests failed on the architecture size budget:
the uncommitted Knowledge Pages changes grew Domain (class and save_domain_info)
and DomainSession (class, export_for_save, import_from_file) past their frozen
baseline. Fixed by extracting shared code instead of raising the budget. Also
aligned the sidebar inventory contract with the new "Pages" section.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/domain/Domain.py
   Graph/cache/Knowledge Pages fields shared by get_domain_info,
   save_domain_info and get_domain_template_data now come from one helper,
   _graph_settings_info(). Removed the _coerce_knowledge_pages wrapper; callers
   use normalize_knowledge_pages directly (top-level import).
2. src/back/objects/session/DomainSession.py
   The domain.info export block moved to module-level _export_domain_info(domain);
   the domain.info import block moved to module-level _import_domain_info(domain,
   info). export_for_save and import_from_file now delegate to them. Behaviour
   unchanged (same normalisation, same defaults, same legacy neo4j_database pop).
3. tests/units/architecture/baseline.json
   Ratchet tightened after the extraction (Domain 2304 -> 2294, DomainSession
   1381 -> 1278, save_domain_info 154 -> 139, import_from_file 188 -> 130,
   export_for_save dropped under budget).
4. tests/units/front/test_sidebar_content_stretch_contract.py
   SECTION_INVENTORY for domain.html includes the new "pages" sidebar section.

